\nBig disappointment.", "timestamp_created": 1741425178, "timestamp_updated": 1743570314, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "189656283", "author": {"steamid": "76561199081846148", "personaname": "manmadesieran", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199081846148/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 105, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 105, "last_played": 1704610087, "avatar": "2da4242378b0528893a86b3aef1d2801833454af"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very Fun and the graphics are very good. A bit confusing on how to play and connect with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1741412293, "timestamp_updated": 1741412293, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}